 { Black's main asset in the Berlin endgame is the light-squared bishop. The pawns on a4, b3 and c4 restrict the bishop, but the same pawns may become vulnerable if Black can get active late in the endgame after some piece exchanges. } 23... { -KEY- } b5 $3 { Or even earlier, as Anand's move shows. } 24. Bc3 $1 ( { If } 24. cxb5 $2 c6 $17 { the b3-pawn soon drops, followed by its colleague on a4. } ) 
