gxh4+ 27. Kh2 { The last two moves, which are far from easy to find, enable a quick f2-f4. White should have enough counterplay to make a draw. For me right now I think being the world number one is a bigger deal than being the World Champion because I think it shows better who plays the best chess. That sounds self-serving but I think it's also right. – Magnus Carlsen } 
